<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don't always go to plan</strong><br />
We’re committed to getting you to your destination on time. However, issues outside of our control, can cause flight delays and cancellations.<br />
<br />
We'll always do our best to give you the seat you have requested, but there might be times when we have to change it for operational, safety, or security reasons.<br />
<br />
We tried to rebook you into a similar seat and apologise that it wasn’t the same as your original booking, as all seats with extra leg room were unavailable.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If handled poorly add:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
I understand it’s frustrating to have your seats changed and I’m sorry our customer service didn’t meet your expectations on this occasion.<br />
<br />
<strong>Your refund is on its way</strong><br />
You can&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/manage-booking/refunds.html">apply for a refund</a> where we change your seat for operational, safety or security reasons or where you’re affected by a flight disruption.<br />
<br />
I’ve already contacted our refunds team on your behalf, and the fees will be refunded back to the original form of payment in approximately 7 business days, depending on your payment method and bank processing times</p>

<p><strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I've passed on your feedback to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
